
# SpendWise Budget Tracker

## Project Description
SpendWise is a simple budgeting application that helps users manage their money by setting a budget, recording expenses, and tracking their remaining balance.

## Improvements Made This Week
- Added an interactive budget tracker.
- Added the ability to set a budget.
- Added the ability to record multiple expenses.
- Added automatic expense calculations.
- Added budgeting feedback.
- Improved the dashboard using JavaScript and DOM manipulation.

## JavaScript Concepts Used

### 1. Conditional Statements
Conditional statements are used to check whether the user has entered valid information and whether expenses are within the budget.

### 2. Arrays
Arrays are used to store multiple expense records, including expense names and amounts.

### 3. Loops
For loops are used to calculate total expenses and display all expense records on the dashboard.

### 4. DOM Manipulation
DOM manipulation is used to update the budget, total expenses, remaining balance, and expense list directly on the webpage.

### 5. Event Listeners
Event listeners respond to button clicks when users set their budgets or add expenses.

## Challenges and Solutions
One challenge was connecting JavaScript to HTML elements. I solved this by using document.getElementById() to access webpage elements.

Another challenge was calculating multiple expenses. I solved this by using arrays and loops to store and calculate expense records.

