## How to Use SpendWise
1. Open the SpendWise application.
2. Enter your budget.
3. Click Set Budget.
4. Enter an expense name and amount.
5. Click Add Expense.
6. View your total expenses and remaining balance.

## Conclusion
SpendWise demonstrates how JavaScript can make a budgeting application interactive through conditional statements, arrays, loops, DOM manipulation, and event listeners.
